; Command file for the bulletins menu

; The first line is the title for the menu

Bulletins

; Now come the menu entries.  Just the three basic commands are provided,
; but for every bulletin you add with TransCfg, you MUST add one
; additional command entry to the end of this file.  This particular
; sample has one bulletin included.

; ********************** *** ********
G Good-Bye (logoff)        0 --------
Q Quit to Main Menu        0 --------
H Help                     0 --------
S System Info              0 --------
